      "after": "**Author-supplied historical review** (described by the author as a separate agent, 2026-09-13; scripts in `repro/reviewer/`). The session identity, model configuration and contextual independence of this historical review have not been authenticated in the present cycle. The following recounts the supplied report and logs."
